# due2 binding module for DPROD Contracts (EKGF, develop, commit 50db943).
# Adds only what DPROD does not declare itself; see due2-profiles.md §2 and §8.
# DPROD's own declarations (operand bindings, policy subclasses, conflict default)
# are read from vendor/dprod/.

@prefix due2:  <https://w3id.org/due2/profile#> .
@prefix dprod: <https://ekgf.org/dprod/spec/develop/> .

dprod:subjectOfDuty due2:playsRole due2:bearer .
dprod:objectOfDuty  due2:playsRole due2:beneficiary .

